{"description":"Welcome to our charming two-story house, located in Boulogne-Billancourt. This spacious and comfortable home has everything you need for a comfortable stay with your family or friends.The spaceEnjoy our bright living room that opens onto a beautiful terrace. Relax and enjoy a morning coffee outdoors or a family meal. A furnished terrace awaits you with a table and chairs. Great place to sunbathe, have a drink or dine outdoors.Our kitchen is fully equipped and has a dining table for family meals. There is also a separate dining area for added convenience.Comfortable BedroomsThe house has three bedrooms with double beds for a peaceful and relaxing sleep.The house has two bathroomsBathroom with modern walk-in shower, ideal for freshening up.The master bedroom has a private bathroom equipped with a bathtub for relaxing moments after a busy day.An additional small living room is at your disposal, equipped with a sofa bed for extra beds, as well as a workspace.You will benefit from portable air conditioners to regulate the temperature according to your preferences during the warmer seasons. In addition, we provide everything you need for a pleasant experience, including sheets, pillows, pillowcases, duvets, as well as small and large towels.The house is conveniently located in Boulogne-Billancourt, close to shops, restaurants and parks. The metro is a short walk away, which will allow you to quickly reach the center of Paris and all its attractions.We are looking forward to hosting you and making your stay unforgettable. Let us know if you have any questions or special requests.Other things to noteAny delay of more than one hour will be charged €20 per hour.Any check-in after 8 p.m. will be charged €20 per hour.","amenities":[{"title":"Bath","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Hairdryer","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Cleaning products","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Shampoo","available":true,"subtitle":""},{"title":"Body soap",